    {
      "type": "anchorbox",
      "title": "The Power of Good Counsel",
      "description": "Vibhishana was surrounded by a toxic, negative environment in Lanka, but he chose to listen to Hanuman's wise advice (Mantra), which ultimately saved his life and made him king. Success heavily depends on seeking out and listening to positive, wise mentors.",
